@lang en
IMPORT `tasco-claims`



§ `Fixtures for the Chương I tests`

`a 2025 contract, premium 3,650,000, paid on signing` MEANS `The contract` WITH
    `date the contract was concluded`                    IS YMD 2025 1 1
    `start of the insurance period`                      IS YMD 2025 1 1
    `end of the insurance period`                        IS YMD 2026 1 1
    `premium`                                            IS 3_650_000
    `agreed date for paying the premium`                 IS NOTHING
    `date the premium was paid in full`                  IS JUST (YMD 2025 1 1)
    `a written agreement lets the buyer owe the premium` IS FALSE
    `vehicle`                                            IS `a private car registered in May 2021`

`a contract never paid, with no agreed time for payment` MEANS `The contract` WITH
    `date the contract was concluded`                    IS YMD 2024 6 1
    `start of the insurance period`                      IS YMD 2024 6 1
    `end of the insurance period`                        IS YMD 2025 5 31
    `premium`                                            IS 10_000_000
    `agreed date for paying the premium`                 IS NOTHING
    `date the premium was paid in full`                  IS NOTHING
    `a written agreement lets the buyer owe the premium` IS FALSE
    `vehicle`                                            IS `a private car registered in May 2021`

`a contract paid on 1 July 2024, with no agreed time for payment` MEANS `The contract` WITH
