    `load carried, towed or lifted`                           IS 1_200
    `permitted number of people`                              IS 5
    `number of people carried, not counting children under 7` IS 4

`8 people where 5 are permitted` MEANS `The load at the time of the loss` WITH
    `permitted load`                                          IS 1_000
    `load carried, towed or lifted`                           IS 800
    `permitted number of people`                              IS 5
    `number of people carried, not counting children under 7` IS 8

